  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Free Shipping\r\n\r\n1. Choose one rule:\r\n   - An order qualifies for free shipping only if the total is over $50 **AND** the customer has a coupon.\r\n   - An order qualifies for free shipping if the total is over $50 **OR** the customer has a coupon. \r\n2. Complete the truth table using the rule you chose.\r\n3. Use the table to build your flowchart.\r\n4. Include all 4 outcomes - one for each row in your table.\r\n5. Save your flowchart to your Backpack.\r\n",
